g through the defection case: if the other twin's prior is held fixed, sending dominates on both payoffs, so the strict A-FDT reading defects whatever that prior is, and both defecting is a consistent fixed point. I could also argue the inputs are isomorphic enough that the function is effectively shared, which might push toward cooperation under a policy-level reading. But since the essay treats the differing letters as separate observation nodes, I'm going with the action version and defecting.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the other twin's output depends on my own decision, given that our observations differ only in irrelevant details. Since the essay holds other instances at their prior, I'm asking whether those priors should stay consistent with what A-FDT outputs under the fixed-point condition.\n\nI'm working through the defection case: if the other twin's prior is held fixed, sending dominates on both payoffs, so the strict A-FDT reading defects whatever that prior is, and both defecting is a consistent fixed point. I could also argue the inputs are isomorphic enough that the function is effectively shared, which might push toward cooperation under a policy-level reading. But since the essay treats the differing letters as separate observation nodes, I'm going with the action version and defecting.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8670,"completion_tokens":734,"total_tokens":9404,"cost":0.04936,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.04936,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03468,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01468},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":311,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}